      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, It is necessary and desirable to amend Executive Order No. 11, outlining the duties and functions of the Criminal Justice Coordinating Council; and\n\nWhereas, It is necessary and desirable to separate the positions of Chairman and Director of the Council to insure more efficient operation in order to better carry out these functions and duties.",
