      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Now, therefore, by the power vested in me as Mayor of The City of New York, it is hereby ordered as follows:\n\nSection 1. Section 2 of Executive Order No. 11 dated March 14, 1974, is hereby amended to read as follows:\n\n\"2. The Mayor shall appoint a Chairman of the Council who shall serve at the pleasure of the Mayor. The Mayor shall also appoint a Director of the Council who shall serve at the pleasure of the Mayor and carry out such duties, functions and responsibilities as may be prescribed by the Chairman.\"",
